	(text "As only a small data packet with sensor-id and charging status\n will be sent over UART, the MUX is used to funnel the signals into one drain.\n\nThe base can then open up the right source,\n when sensor was newly docked and await its transmission.\n\nWhen multiple sensors are docked, the sources are periodically listened to\ne.g. every 500ms. The sensors send e.g. every 200ms. \nAdd a condition to check if the line was idle for \ne.g. 10ms before switching to next source to prevent broken packages."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 211.836 155.702 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.762 0.762)
				(thickness 0.127)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4766c78d-f14d-4ca9-8b4b-bed741f2c6e4")
	)
